WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.746 --> 00:00:13.317
Open your project, and the Dashboard is the first thing you see: how the job is going today.

2
00:00:13.317 --> 00:00:20.773
The cost snapshot shows how much has been spent against the budget. Press Full cost analytics for the detail.

3
00:00:20.774 --> 00:00:33.538
Further down, the phase timeline shows each stage of the job, and the schedule below it puts every task on a calendar. Switch it between day, week and month, or show the critical path.

4
00:00:33.538 --> 00:00:47.401
Share with client creates a link for your client. You choose what they see: site photos, daily work updates, a payment summary, the number of workers. Your notes, costs and rates are never shown.

5
00:00:47.401 --> 00:00:52.070
Close it when you're done. Links you've shared are listed under Active links.
